	<div class="fsElement fsContent footer-content" id="fsEl_2731" data-use-new="true" >

				<div class="fsElementContent" >
			<p style="text-align: center; line-height: 14px; margin-left: 40px; margin-right: 40px;"><small>The School District of South Orange &amp; Maplewood&nbsp;is committed to making our content accessible to all members of the public, including those with disabilities. This includes families, students, employees, and all others associated with our community. If you need assistance in accessing materials on the district website, or you would like to provide <a href="https://www.somsdk12.org/feedback" style="color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: none; text-decoration-thickness: 0.1rem;" target="_blank">feedback</a>/recommendation on a school&nbsp;page, please email the district&#39;s communications office at <a href="mailto:information@somsd.k12.nj.us" style="color: #ffffff; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline dotted #A2AAAD; text-decoration-thickness: 0.1rem;" target="_blank">information@somsd.k12.nj.us</a></small></p>


	</div>


	</div>
	


	</div>


	</div>
	
